{"timestamp": 1779338151.243426, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I found Eve\u2019s body in Security, right on top of/near the camera area. My route this round was Storage -> Medbay -> Electrical -> Security. I saw Alice in Electrical around ticks 9 and 10, but I didn\u2019t see anyone else before finding the body. I\u2019m not accusing Alice just from that \u2014 just giving the info I have."}}
{"timestamp": 1779338176.400815, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I did pass through Security earlier, so I want to be upfront. My route was Cafeteria \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Electrical \u2192 Security \u2192 Weapons \u2192 Cafeteria/Oxygen. When I was in/near Security, Eve was alive \u2014 I saw her come in from Navigation, and around the same time Bob left Security toward Navigation. After that I went up through Weapons and didn\u2019t go back.\n\nSo the main thing I have is: Eve was alive in Security when I left, and Bob was the last person I saw around that area. Not hard accusing yet, but Bob\u2019s timing is definitely worth hearing. Alice being in Electrical also fits Diana\u2019s info, but I didn\u2019t personally see Alice at the body."}}
{"timestamp": 1779338201.609428, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I started in Security, went up to Weapons, came back through Security, then went down/right to Navigation where I was when the report happened. At tick 6 in Security I saw Charlie enter from Electrical and Eve enter from Navigation. So yes, I was around that area, but Charlie was also literally in Security with Eve at the same time.\n\nI did not see a body when I passed back through Security, and I didn\u2019t kill Eve. Charlie saying I was \u201clast\u201d around there feels a bit incomplete because from my POV both Charlie and Eve were there too, and then I left toward my Navigation task. Diana finding it after coming from Electrical makes Alice\u2019s location worth hearing too. I\u2019m not hard accusing yet, but I want Alice and Frank\u2019s routes before we vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779338222.495022, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I don\u2019t have much direct info, unfortunately. My route was upper engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 back through upper engine \u2192 lower engine, and I didn\u2019t see anyone at all this round, so I can\u2019t clear or place anybody near Security.\n\nFrom what\u2019s been said, the useful info is that Eve was alive in Security with Bob and Charlie around that timing, then Diana finds her in Security later after coming from Electrical. Bob and Charlie both put each other near Eve, and Diana says Alice was in Electrical around ticks 9\u201310, which is right next to Security.\n\nI\u2019m not hard accusing yet. I want to hear Alice\u2019s route, because Alice was closest to the body area from Diana\u2019s info. If Alice\u2019s story doesn\u2019t line up, that\u2019s suspicious. Otherwise the main question is Bob vs Charlie timing around when Eve died."}}
{"timestamp": 1779338250.111347, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "My route was lower engine \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical. I was in Electrical doing my task when Diana came through \u2014 I saw her there around ticks 9 and 10. I never went into Security this round and I didn\u2019t see Eve at all.\n\nSo from my perspective, Diana can at least confirm I was still in Electrical right before she found the body. I don\u2019t have direct evidence on the kill, but based on everyone\u2019s stories, the important conflict is Bob and Charlie both being in/around Security with Eve alive. Frank was far away, and I was in Electrical when Diana passed me.\n\nI\u2019m leaning that this is between Bob and Charlie unless Diana is self-reporting, but her route matches seeing me in Electrical and then going into Security. Bob and Charlie both need scrutiny: Charlie says Bob was last around Eve, Bob says Charlie was also right there. I think voting should probably be on whichever of Bob/Charlie has the worse timing, not on me or Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779338278.158047, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I\u2019ll restate my info: I found Eve dead in Security at the cameras area. I came Storage \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Electrical \u2192 Security, and I saw Alice in Electrical at ticks 9 and 10 before I went into Security and reported.\n\nThat makes me think Alice is less likely unless she somehow moved right after me, but I didn\u2019t see her in Security. Frank\u2019s route is far away and nobody contradicts it.\n\nSo I agree this is mainly Bob vs Charlie. Both place themselves in Security with Eve alive. The key detail for me is Bob being seen leaving toward Navigation, and the body was found in Security shortly after. Bob also ended in Navigation, right next to Security, which gives him a pretty easy kill-and-leave path. Charlie could be lying too, but based on the timing, I\u2019m leaning Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779338300.699765, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Yeah, I agree with Diana\u2019s read. The part that bothers me is Bob\u2019s route gives him a clean chance to double back: Security \u2194 Navigation is short, and he says he ended in Navigation when the report happened.\n\nTo be clear on my timing: I came into Security from Electrical, saw Eve come in from Navigation, and saw Bob leave Security toward Navigation. I did not stay there \u2014 I went up to Weapons and then toward Cafeteria/Oxygen. I never went back to Security after that.\n\nSo from my POV, Eve was alive when I left, and Bob was the person positioned right next to that area afterward. Alice being seen in Electrical by Diana makes Alice less likely to me, and Frank was nowhere near it. I\u2019m leaning Bob here unless someone has a stronger contradiction."}}
{"timestamp": 1779338322.188554, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I need to push back on the \u201cBob can double back\u201d idea: I didn\u2019t double back. My route was Security \u2192 Weapons \u2192 back through Security \u2192 Navigation, and I was in Navigation when the report happened.\n\nThe key moment is tick 6: I saw Charlie enter Security from Electrical, and Eve enter Security from Navigation. So Eve was alive with both me and Charlie there. Charlie keeps saying I was \u201clast\u201d because he saw me leave toward Navigation, but from my perspective Charlie was also in the room with Eve at that exact timing, and he\u2019s the one trying to narrow it onto me.\n\nIf I killed Eve in Security, I\u2019d have to kill and then go to Navigation without anyone seeing the body immediately \u2014 but I\u2019m saying when I passed through Security, there was no body. Charlie had a route through Security and then up to Weapons, which is also a clean exit away from the body.\n\nAlice is mostly cleared by Diana seeing her in Electrical, Frank was far, Diana reported. So I agree it\u2019s probably between me and Charlie, but Charlie\u2019s framing feels selective. I\u2019m leaning Charlie here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779338347.912699, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I\u2019m still far from the body, so I can\u2019t add direct sightings. My only solid info is I was upper engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 upper engine \u2192 lower engine and saw nobody, so I\u2019m not involved in the Security timing.\n\nFrom the discussion, I\u2019m mostly clearing Alice for now because Diana and Alice both match on Electrical at ticks 9\u201310, right before the report. Diana self-report is possible in theory, but with Bob and Charlie both admitting they were in Security with Eve alive earlier, that feels less likely.\n\nSo I agree this vote is probably Bob or Charlie. The thing that makes me lean Bob is that multiple accounts put him leaving toward Navigation, which is directly connected to Security, and he also ended there when the body was found. Charlie\u2019s route takes him away through Weapons, while Bob\u2019s gives the easier kill-and-leave path.\n\nI\u2019m not 100%, but I\u2019m leaning Bob based on opportunity and positioning."}}
{"timestamp": 1779338355.7755089, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I\u2019ll keep it simple: my only solid info is I was lower engine \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical, and I was doing my Electrical task when Diana came through. I saw Diana in Electrical around ticks 9\u201310, and she can confirm I was still there right before she went into Security and found Eve.\n\nI never entered Security and never saw Eve. From what everyone has said, I don\u2019t think this is on Frank, and I don\u2019t think Diana\u2019s report looks fake because her route lines up with seeing me first.\n\nSo for me it\u2019s really Bob vs Charlie. Both admit they were in Security with Eve alive. The difference is Charlie says he left upward toward Weapons, while Bob was moving between Security and Navigation and ended in Navigation, which is directly next to where the body was found. That gives Bob the cleaner opportunity to kill and leave.\n\nI\u2019m not 100% certain, but based on positioning and timing, I\u2019m leaning Bob."}}
